msgid "Qiskit Mitigation {#qiskit-mitigation}"
msgstr "Qiskit Mitigation {#qiskit-mitigation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Mitigation is a package for handling noise in quantum computations. It contains a set of techniques that can be used to build advanced or customized error mitigation pipelines directly with [samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic). Specifically, it contains:\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Mitigation adalah paket untuk menangani noise dalam komputasi kuantum. Paket ini berisi sekumpulan teknik yang bisa dipakai untuk membangun pipeline mitigasi error tingkat lanjut atau kustom langsung dengan [samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic). Secara khusus, paket ini berisi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implementations of Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX), and Zero-Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) with Probabilistic Error Amplification (PEA) and gate folding amplification methods.\n"
msgstr "Implementasi Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX), dan Zero-Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) dengan metode amplifikasi Probabilistic Error Amplification (PEA) dan gate folding.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Functionality for computing a postselected noise channel, from circuit symmetries or spacetime checks, to be used with PEC to reduce sampling overhead [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Fungsionalitas untuk menghitung kanal noise terpostselection, dari simetri circuit atau pemeriksaan spacetime, untuk dipakai bersama PEC guna mengurangi overhead sampling [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Postselection using non-Markovian error checks to filter corrupted samples out of measured data.\n"
msgstr "Postselection dengan pemeriksaan error non-Markovian untuk menyaring sampel yang rusak dari data hasil pengukuran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for expectation value calculation with advanced error mitigation.\n"
msgstr "Dukungan untuk perhitungan nilai ekspektasi dengan mitigasi error tingkat lanjut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
