msgid "Contributing {#contributing}"
msgstr "Berkontribusi {#contributing}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The source code is available [on GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation).\n"
msgstr "Kode sumber tersedia [di GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The developer guide is located at [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) in the root of this project’s repository. By participating, you are expected to uphold Qiskit’s [code of conduct](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n"
msgstr "Panduan developer ada di [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) pada root repositori proyek ini. Dengan berpartisipasi, kamu diharapkan menjunjung [kode etik](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) Qiskit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose) for tracking requests and bugs.\n"
msgstr "Kami memakai [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose) untuk melacak permintaan dan bug.\n"

